            "id": 146800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam tanda kurung, buat variabel penghitung dan kondisi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;XP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let i = 50</code>, diikuti oleh <code>;</code>, lalu <code>i &lt; 55</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
